1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,300
云南边境小县，藏着中国最好的咖啡。
A tiny border county hides China's best coffee.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,600
孟连，精品率71%，全省第一。
Menglian: 71% specialty grade — No.1 in Yunnan.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,900
11万亩咖啡，一万六千户人家在种。
110,000 mu of coffee, 16,000 farm households.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:13,200
清晨上山，只摘红透的果子。
Dawn on the slopes — only the ripe red cherries.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,500
1988年就开始种，产值超13亿。
Grown since 1988 — now ¥1.3B in output.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,800
一颗小豆子，种出一个"第一县"。
One small bean built a "No.1 county."

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,100
从边境到杯子，云南豆越走越远。
From the border to your cup — Yunnan beans travel far.

8
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:26,400
你杯里的咖啡，来自云南吗？
Is the coffee in your cup from Yunnan?
